* {{rhymes|en|ɪʃən|s=3}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The act of [[ignite|igniting]].
# The [[initiation]] of [[combustion]].
# {{lb|en|automotive|mechanical engineering}} A [[system]] for [[activate|activating]] [[combustion]] in a combustion [[engine]].
# {{lb|en|automotive}} Receptacle for a key used to start the engine in a vehicle.
#: {{ux|en|Put the key in the '''ignition''' and turn in right.}}
# {{lb|en|physics}} The phenomenon of a [[thermonuclear]] [[fusion]] reaction becoming [[self-sustaining]] and no longer requiring external [[heat]]ing.{{wikipedia|fusion ignition}}

